Top Priority:

[FIXED] I can’t talk to town leaders. I get the message “the seat still stands (kill the ruler first)” as though I’m trying to take the place. I just want to talk. (Assuming that the person inside the town hall is actually the leader — that’s also unclear.)
    The conquest flag stands at the hall door and the ruler stood a stride behind it, so the
    flag's click radius ate every right-click on them. A person nearer the cursor than the flag
    now wins the click; the ruler stands a stride further in; leaders wear their title over
